Each "GO_*" file contains a list of GO terms associated to the keywords that were used to define proliferation and differentiation functional categories.
   Proliferation:
	mitotic-cell-cycle       
	mRNA-metabolic-process
	chromatin-modification  
	negative-regulation-cell-cycle
	chromatin-remodeling    
	nucleosome-assembly    
	translation
   Differentiation:
	development    
	differentiation
	cell-adhesion
	pattern-specification       
	multicellular-organism-growth
	angiogenesis            


Each file "GO_*.excluded" provides a list of GO terms that match the keyword but correspond to its negation (for example,  “negative regulation of angiogenesis” was excluded from the “angiogenesis” category)

Each "genes_*" file provides a list of genes associated to proliferation, differentiation or both.


